  "description": "Debug by trace ID: paste a trace_id and see every log line and span belonging to that trace in one place.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "datasource",
        "uid": "grafana"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "## Trace ID Debugging\n\n1. Find a `trace_id` — from any log line (the **Prabogo - Logs** dashboard shows a `trace_id` column), from an error message, or from app output.\n2. Paste it into the **Trace ID** selector above.\n3. The **Trace Spans** and **Logs for Trace** panels fill in with all data sharing that trace.\n\nThe trace ID is the standard 32-char OTel hex form (e.g. `0eda30cc5b4eeded1f9cb8c56e0610c9`). Tempo >= 2.10 accepts this form in TraceQL `trace:id =` queries, so a single ID works in both the Tempo and Loki panels below.\n\nClicking a `trace_id` in any log opens the trace; clicking a span opens its logs & metrics (configured via the LGTM datasource correlations).",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "12.1.0",
      "title": "",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "Tempo"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "inspect": false
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "duration"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "ns"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "desc": true,
            "displayName": "duration"
          }
        ]
      },
      "pluginVersion": "13.1.3",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "Tempo"
          },
          "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"prabogo\" && trace:id = \"${traceid}\" } | select(name, status, duration, resource.service.name, kind)",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Trace Spans (operationName / service / status / duration)",
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "Loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "12.1.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "Loki"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "{service_name=\"prabogo\"} | json | traceid=\"${traceid}\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Logs for Trace ${traceid}",
      "type": "logs"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "10s",
